===Format===
*'''Group Stage''' (Best-of-3)
**There will be only one group stage
**A group comprises of 4 teams
**Groups are played in the [http://wiki.teamliquid.net/starcraft/Dual_tournament Dual Tournament Format] (only matches with stakes are played)
**The top 2 in each group will advance to the playoffs
**From group stage to playoffs the teams will advance in a way that won't repeat any match-ups
*'''Playoffs''' (Best-of-3)
**8 teams single-elimination bracket with bronze match
*'''Map picking'''
**Map pool: dm2, dm3, e1m2
**The higher seeded team decides if they want to pick first and toss last or vice versa (maps '''can't''' be repeated)
*'''Allowed clients'''
**ezQuake >= v2.1 (ruleset smackdown, qcon, thunderdome)
**FodQuake >= v0.2 (ruleset eql)
**FTEQW >= v1.0 (ruleset nqr)
*'''Game settings'''
**The default /4on4 settings on the QHLAN servers apply
